  "body": [
    "Step into a world of wonder and enter for a chance to win a Golden Ticket Experience! You could win a truly extraordinary grand prize: A magical trip to the Netflix House in Las Vegas.",
    "To interact with Wonka’s World, open the camera on your smartphone and scan the code above.",
    "Activate your phone’s camera to enjoy a magical digital unwrapping experience. Find out if you've won the legendary Wonka Golden Ticket!",
    "Winner and and three guests will receive a four day, three night trip to Las Vegas and VIP tickets for admission to the Netflix House on the Las Vegas Strip.",
    "The Factory Bundle is a tiny treasure from a bigger wonderland: a tote bag with Wonka goodies.",
    "NO PURCHASE NECESSARY TO ENTER OR WIN. A PURCHASE DOES NOT INCREASE YOUR CHANCES OF WINNING. Open only to legal residents of the 50 United States and D.C., who are 21 years of age or older with a valid email account as of the time of entry. Void where prohibited. Sweepstakes begins at 9:00:00 AM (ET) on November 2, 2026, and ends at 11:59:59 PM (ET) on July 31, 2027. One (1) Golden Ticket Experience Prize (via Instant Win or Random Drawing) and one (1) Wonka Factory Bundle Instant Win Prize per person for the entire Promotion Period. Unclaimed or forfeited Instant Win Prizes will not be awarded. For complete details including how to enter, odds of winning and prizing see Official Rules at www.wonka.com or scan QR code on specially marked packs of Ferrero brand Wonka products or advertising display. Data usage rates may apply. Sponsor: Ferrero U.S.A., Inc., Parsippany, NJ 07054 and Wells Enterprises, Inc., 1 Blue Bunny Drive, Le Mars, Iowa 51031"
  ],
